    "body": "```suggestion\r\nform.method === input; // => true\r\n\r\nform.enctype;           // => \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\"\r\ninput.id = \"enctype\";   // DOM clobbering occurs here as well\r\nform.enctype === input; // => true</code></pre>\r\n```",
